    "detailed_description": "Creepy Tales is a cooperative horror and survival game for 1 to 4 players. The players take on the roles of orphans trapped in an eerie orphanage run by a priest possessed by a malevolent entity. Navigate through terrifying challenges, uncover dark secrets, and work together to defeat the possessed priest. Survive the horrors, save your friends, and escape the nightmare!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Online co-op for 1 to 4 players<br />\r\nTake control of up to 4 orphans in this unique cooperative experience, where you need to work together to stop the possessed priest determined to hunt you. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Challenging gameplay<br />\r\nNo game of Creepy Tales is the same as another. To stop the evil, you will need a focused team and perfect execution. A single game can take up to 15 minutes.",
    "about_the_game": "Creepy Tales is a cooperative horror and survival game for 1 to 4 players. The players take on the roles of orphans trapped in an eerie orphanage run by a priest possessed by a malevolent entity. Navigate through terrifying challenges, uncover dark secrets, and work together to defeat the possessed priest. Survive the horrors, save your friends, and escape the nightmare!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Online co-op for 1 to 4 players<br />\r\nTake control of up to 4 orphans in this unique cooperative experience, where you need to work together to stop the possessed priest determined to hunt you. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Challenging gameplay<br />\r\nNo game of Creepy Tales is the same as another. To stop the evil, you will need a focused team and perfect execution. A single game can take up to 15 minutes.",
    "short_description": "Creepy Tales is a cooperative horror and survival game for 1 to 4 players. The players are orphans in an orphanage run by a priest possessed by an evil entity. Defeat him, survive, and save your friends!",
